Yearly reminder: To get natbib \citep and \citet commands working properly with NeurIPS citation style (numbers rather than author lists), use the following commands.

\usepackage[nonatbib]{neurips_2021}
\usepackage[numbers]{natbib}
...
\bibliographystyle{abbrvnat}

A trivial point in current circumstances, but took me way too long to figure out, so hopefully of use to others: 
To get \citep and \citet annotations working with NeurIPS style:
\usepackage[nonatbib]{neurips_2020}
\usepackage[numbers]{natbib}
...
\bibliographystyle{abbrvnat}
